  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The pronoun Y",
   "texto": [
    "**Y** replaces a place (**à**, **dans**, **chez** + place): **Je vais à la piscine** → **J'y vais**. You can also replace **à + cosa o idea**: **Je pense à mes vacances** → **J'y pense** (I think of them). For one person, say **Je pense à lui/elle**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Where are you going?",
   "texto": [
    "Like other pronouns, **y** goes **delante del verbo**: **J'y vais**, **Il y est**.",
    "It is not put behind the verb: it is not said **Il est y**."
   ]
  },
